  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "他一辈子没结婚，没孩子，却是五万个孩子的妈。昨天咱们讲了，有位老人临死前嘴里喊的是快拿产钱来，有人就问她到底是谁怎么这么神，她叫林巧智。今天咱们就好好唠唠一个妈字，在他身上到底有多重？先问您一个问题，这世界上有没有一种妈一辈子没生过一个孩子，却有五万多个孩子把他当妈有，就是他一九零一年林巧至出生在厦门鼓浪屿那地方，您去过就知道海风一吹，满岛都是钢琴声，美的跟花儿似的。可她的命苦，五岁那年，母亲得了宫颈癌，在那会儿管这叫妇科肿瘤，基本没救。他跪在床边，眼泪啪嗒啪嗒掉小手攥着妈妈的手，眼睁睁看着妈妈闭上眼睛。您想想一个五岁的小姑娘眼睁睁看着亲妈没了，那是什么滋味？从那一刻起，他心里就种下一颗种子，我要当医生，我要让别人的妈不再死。一九二一年，他二十岁去考协和医学院，百里挑一，考最后一门英语的时候，考场里一个女生中暑晕倒了。监考老师是男的，福也不是不服，也不是别的考生都低头做题，只有他把笔一扔，冲过去救人。等他忙活完，英语考试结束了，他以为自己肯定落榜了。可一个月后，录取通知书到家了。考官说，能放下自己的前程去救人，这就是当医生的料，分数可以补考，人品却补不了。进了协和医院，他选了妇产科，那时候妇产科又脏又累没人愿意干，医院还撂下一句话，女医生结婚就得走人。他二话没说，直接把自己嫁给了医院，一辈子没结婚没孩子。有人问他，你不后悔。他说，我最爱听的声音就是婴儿出生后的第一声啼哭。这句话他说了几十年，也做到了几十年，他有个习惯给孕妇听。开心之前，先把兵粮的听诊器贴在自己手心里，无热再放到孕妇肚子上。冬天那个凉劲儿能让人一机灵，就这一个动作，他做了一辈子，从来没省略过。他说，母亲已经在受罪了，能少一点粮就少一点粮，产妇疼的大喊大叫，别的医生手足无措。他走过去，摸摸产妇的头，握握产妇的手，产妇立马就安静了。有人说这是神迹，其实哪儿有什么神迹，就是他打心眼里把产妇当亲人，人一靠近心就安了。他接生的孩子里，有一个，您肯定认识袁隆平。一九三零年协和医院的出生档案上，那个小名叫袁小孩的男婴，杰生医生一栏写着三个英文单词QG零。后来袁隆平成了杂交水稻之父，他说，自己能由林大夫接生，是莫大的荣幸。还有一位钟南山院士见到他得规规矩矩喊一声姑婆。一九四一年，太平洋战争爆发，协和医院关门了，他就在东塘子胡同开了间。小诊所达官贵人来看病，他接嗯拉洋车的人来看病，他也解碰上真穷的，他不收钱，还倒贴自己掏钱给产妇买鸡蛋买红糖。六七年下来，他攒下八千八百八十八份病例，每一份都工工整整。您知道他写病历有多认真吗？他说，医生要把字写好，这是最起码的底线。看惯了龙飞凤舞的字，您再看看他的病历，娟绣工整，唯恐病人看错一个字，这不是字好不好看的事，这是心里有没有病人？一九六二年，一个刚出生几小时的婴儿，全身发黄，眼看不行了，这种病国内没人治过，家属都快放弃了。同事劝他别接，他摇头道，只要有一线希望，我就得试试。他翻外文资料一页一页找找到一种办法，脐待换血，第一次没成功，第二次又复发，第三次孩子终于哭出了声。这是中国第一例被救回来的新生儿溶血症患儿。他救的不是一个孩子，是身后的一整个家。一九八三年四月二十二号，八十二岁的林巧志走了，临终昏迷中，他突然喊快快拿产钱来，护士抓了样东西塞在他手里，他慢慢平静下来，过了一会儿，脸上露出一丝微笑，又是一个胖娃娃。一晚上，三个真好一辈子。最后一句话，还是产房的事儿。他留下遗嘱，积蓄三万元，全部捐给幼儿园、托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究，骨灰洒回鼓浪屿的海面。他没当过妈，却让五万多个家庭圆了妈这个字。他的这一生被完整收进了一本书，国之脊梁。中科院学部编的图文并茂，里面不光有林巧智，还有钱学森、袁隆平、邓稼先等四十位中国科学家的真实人生。大人读的心热孩子看得进去链接，我放在视频左下角了，感兴趣的朋友可以直接拍下，拿到手细细品读。如果您也心疼这位林妈妈，点个赞转发给身边的女性长辈，告诉她，您和您的孩子都曾被这样的人守护过。收藏这条视频，下期咱们讲讲开国大典的那天，他为什么没有去？",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1410,
      "text": "他一辈子没结婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1410,
      "end_ms": 2130,
      "text": "没孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2310,
      "end_ms": 3990,
      "text": "却是五万个孩子的妈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4870,
      "end_ms": 6090,
      "text": "昨天咱们讲了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6630,
      "end_ms": 10810,
      "text": "有位老人临死前嘴里喊的是快拿产钱来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11650,
      "end_ms": 15650,
      "text": "有人就问她到底是谁怎么这么神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15930,
      "end_ms": 16910,
      "text": "她叫林巧智。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17810,
      "end_ms": 21150,
      "text": "今天咱们就好好唠唠一个妈字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22050,
      "end_ms": 24930,
      "text": "在他身上到底有多重？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 26070,
      "end_ms": 27270,
      "text": "先问您一个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28250,
      "end_ms": 34920,
      "text": "这世界上有没有一种妈一辈子没生过一个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35180,
      "end_ms": 37920,
      "text": "却有五万多个孩子把他当妈有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 38300,
      "end_ms": 46180,
      "text": "就是他一九零一年林巧至出生在厦门鼓浪屿那地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 46180,
      "end_ms": 48320,
      "text": "您去过就知道海风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 48620,
      "end_ms": 50180,
      "text": "满岛都是钢琴声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 50660,
      "end_ms": 52100,
      "text": "美的跟花儿似的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 52640,
      "end_ms": 53980,
      "text": "可她的命苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 54780,
      "end_ms": 55680,
      "text": "五岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 56040,
      "end_ms": 57420,
      "text": "母亲得了宫颈癌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57780,
      "end_ms": 60055,
      "text": "在那会儿管这叫妇科肿瘤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 60420,
      "end_ms": 61325,
      "text": "基本没救。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61830,
      "end_ms": 62910,
      "text": "他跪在床边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 63150,
      "end_ms": 67035,
      "text": "眼泪啪嗒啪嗒掉小手攥着妈妈的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 67440,
      "end_ms": 70095,
      "text": "眼睁睁看着妈妈闭上眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 70630,
      "end_ms": 76160,
      "text": "您想想一个五岁的小姑娘眼睁睁看着亲妈没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 76160,
      "end_ms": 77175,
      "text": "那是什么滋味？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 78100,
      "end_ms": 79175,
      "text": "从那一刻起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79500,
      "end_ms": 81415,
      "text": "他心里就种下一颗种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 82030,
      "end_ms": 82945,
      "text": "我要当医生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 83440,
      "end_ms": 86365,
      "text": "我要让别人的妈不再死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 87540,
      "end_ms": 88545,
      "text": "一九二一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88860,
      "end_ms": 92315,
      "text": "他二十岁去考协和医学院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 92820,
      "end_ms": 93795,
      "text": "百里挑一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 94360,
      "end_ms": 96320,
      "text": "考最后一门英语的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 96520,
      "end_ms": 98945,
      "text": "考场里一个女生中暑晕倒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 99440,
      "end_ms": 100785,
      "text": "监考老师是男的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 101280,
      "end_ms": 102560,
      "text": "福也不是不服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 102560,
      "end_ms": 105145,
      "text": "也不是别的考生都低头做题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 105760,
      "end_ms": 107435,
      "text": "只有他把笔一扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 107750,
      "end_ms": 108685,
      "text": "冲过去救人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 109510,
      "end_ms": 110455,
      "text": "等他忙活完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110800,
      "end_ms": 112185,
      "text": "英语考试结束了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 112310,
      "end_ms": 113835,
      "text": "他以为自己肯定落榜了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 114690,
      "end_ms": 115510,
      "text": "可一个月后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 115750,
      "end_ms": 117445,
      "text": "录取通知书到家了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 118250,
      "end_ms": 118870,
      "text": "考官说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 119210,
      "end_ms": 121655,
      "text": "能放下自己的前程去救人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 122090,
      "end_ms": 123525,
      "text": "这就是当医生的料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 124290,
      "end_ms": 125665,
      "text": "分数可以补考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 126080,
      "end_ms": 127435,
      "text": "人品却补不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127950,
      "end_ms": 129190,
      "text": "进了协和医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 129310,
      "end_ms": 130615,
      "text": "他选了妇产科，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131060,
      "end_ms": 134185,
      "text": "那时候妇产科又脏又累没人愿意干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 134640,
      "end_ms": 136215,
      "text": "医院还撂下一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 136610,
      "end_ms": 138765,
      "text": "女医生结婚就得走人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 139420,
      "end_ms": 140460,
      "text": "他二话没说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 140840,
      "end_ms": 142905,
      "text": "直接把自己嫁给了医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 144000,
      "end_ms": 147560,
      "text": "一辈子没结婚没孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 147680,
      "end_ms": 148540,
      "text": "有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 148560,
      "end_ms": 149445,
      "text": "你不后悔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 150530,
      "end_ms": 150990,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 152060,
      "end_ms": 158355,
      "text": "我最爱听的声音就是婴儿出生后的第一声啼哭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 159150,
      "end_ms": 161895,
      "text": "这句话他说了几十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 163330,
      "end_ms": 164755,
      "text": "也做到了几十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 166380,
      "end_ms": 168750,
      "text": "他有个习惯给孕妇听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 168750,
      "end_ms": 169635,
      "text": "开心之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 170070,
      "end_ms": 174550,
      "text": "先把兵粮的听诊器贴在自己手心里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 174550,
      "end_ms": 177445,
      "text": "无热再放到孕妇肚子上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 177880,
      "end_ms": 180635,
      "text": "冬天那个凉劲儿能让人一机灵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 181020,
      "end_ms": 182085,
      "text": "就这一个动作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 182560,
      "end_ms": 183615,
      "text": "他做了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 183900,
      "end_ms": 185145,
      "text": "从来没省略过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 185860,
      "end_ms": 186395,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 187680,
      "end_ms": 189245,
      "text": "母亲已经在受罪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 190480,
      "end_ms": 192995,
      "text": "能少一点粮就少一点粮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 193680,
      "end_ms": 195300,
      "text": "产妇疼的大喊大叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 195480,
      "end_ms": 197265,
      "text": "别的医生手足无措。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 197730,
      "end_ms": 198615,
      "text": "他走过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 198950,
      "end_ms": 200195,
      "text": "摸摸产妇的头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 200540,
      "end_ms": 201845,
      "text": "握握产妇的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 202340,
      "end_ms": 204035,
      "text": "产妇立马就安静了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 205410,
      "end_ms": 206815,
      "text": "有人说这是神迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 207400,
      "end_ms": 209005,
      "text": "其实哪儿有什么神迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 209370,
      "end_ms": 212315,
      "text": "就是他打心眼里把产妇当亲人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 212690,
      "end_ms": 215015,
      "text": "人一靠近心就安了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 215460,
      "end_ms": 216905,
      "text": "他接生的孩子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 217210,
      "end_ms": 217790,
      "text": "有一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 217790,
      "end_ms": 221955,
      "text": "您肯定认识袁隆平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 222570,
      "end_ms": 226345,
      "text": "一九三零年协和医院的出生档案上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 226680,
      "end_ms": 229205,
      "text": "那个小名叫袁小孩的男婴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 230630,
      "end_ms": 235640,
      "text": "杰生医生一栏写着三个英文单词QG零。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 236260,
      "end_ms": 239785,
      "text": "后来袁隆平成了杂交水稻之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 240570,
      "end_ms": 240950,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 240970,
      "end_ms": 242775,
      "text": "自己能由林大夫接生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 243210,
      "end_ms": 244625,
      "text": "是莫大的荣幸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 245220,
      "end_ms": 253575,
      "text": "还有一位钟南山院士见到他得规规矩矩喊一声姑婆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 254060,
      "end_ms": 255060,
      "text": "一九四一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 255060,
      "end_ms": 256235,
      "text": "太平洋战争爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 256750,
      "end_ms": 258055,
      "text": "协和医院关门了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 259190,
      "end_ms": 261540,
      "text": "他就在东塘子胡同开了间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 261540,
      "end_ms": 264395,
      "text": "小诊所达官贵人来看病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 264780,
      "end_ms": 267450,
      "text": "他接嗯拉洋车的人来看病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 267530,
      "end_ms": 269795,
      "text": "他也解碰上真穷的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 270020,
      "end_ms": 270705,
      "text": "他不收钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 271070,
      "end_ms": 275165,
      "text": "还倒贴自己掏钱给产妇买鸡蛋买红糖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 275930,
      "end_ms": 276990,
      "text": "六七年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 277190,
      "end_ms": 280745,
      "text": "他攒下八千八百八十八份病例，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 281150,
      "end_ms": 283105,
      "text": "每一份都工工整整。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 283390,
      "end_ms": 285925,
      "text": "您知道他写病历有多认真吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 286770,
      "end_ms": 287190,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 287470,
      "end_ms": 288850,
      "text": "医生要把字写好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 289050,
      "end_ms": 290665,
      "text": "这是最起码的底线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 291660,
      "end_ms": 293680,
      "text": "看惯了龙飞凤舞的字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 293940,
      "end_ms": 295480,
      "text": "您再看看他的病历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 295960,
      "end_ms": 297040,
      "text": "娟绣工整，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 297460,
      "end_ms": 299780,
      "text": "唯恐病人看错一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 300220,
      "end_ms": 302300,
      "text": "这不是字好不好看的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 302740,
      "end_ms": 304640,
      "text": "这是心里有没有病人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 304760,
      "end_ms": 305900,
      "text": "一九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 306220,
      "end_ms": 308760,
      "text": "一个刚出生几小时的婴儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00121",
      "start_ms": 309080,
      "end_ms": 310200,
      "text": "全身发黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00122",
      "start_ms": 310620,
      "end_ms": 311820,
      "text": "眼看不行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00123",
      "start_ms": 312120,
      "end_ms": 313960,
      "text": "这种病国内没人治过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00124",
      "start_ms": 314200,
      "end_ms": 315760,
      "text": "家属都快放弃了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00125",
      "start_ms": 316360,
      "end_ms": 317740,
      "text": "同事劝他别接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00126",
      "start_ms": 318300,
      "end_ms": 319180,
      "text": "他摇头道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00127",
      "start_ms": 319360,
      "end_ms": 320700,
      "text": "只要有一线希望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00128",
      "start_ms": 320700,
      "end_ms": 322070,
      "text": "我就得试试。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00129",
      "start_ms": 322950,
      "end_ms": 327450,
      "text": "他翻外文资料一页一页找找到一种办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00130",
      "start_ms": 327870,
      "end_ms": 328710,
      "text": "脐待换血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00131",
      "start_ms": 328910,
      "end_ms": 329910,
      "text": "第一次没成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00132",
      "start_ms": 330130,
      "end_ms": 331170,
      "text": "第二次又复发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00133",
      "start_ms": 331650,
      "end_ms": 334930,
      "text": "第三次孩子终于哭出了声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00134",
      "start_ms": 335990,
      "end_ms": 340790,
      "text": "这是中国第一例被救回来的新生儿溶血症患儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00135",
      "start_ms": 340910,
      "end_ms": 345220,
      "text": "他救的不是一个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00136",
      "start_ms": 345960,
      "end_ms": 347760,
      "text": "是身后的一整个家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00137",
      "start_ms": 348720,
      "end_ms": 351035,
      "text": "一九八三年四月二十二号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00138",
      "start_ms": 352030,
      "end_ms": 355040,
      "text": "八十二岁的林巧志走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00139",
      "start_ms": 357170,
      "end_ms": 358465,
      "text": "临终昏迷中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00140",
      "start_ms": 359470,
      "end_ms": 362785,
      "text": "他突然喊快快拿产钱来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00141",
      "start_ms": 363760,
      "end_ms": 366105,
      "text": "护士抓了样东西塞在他手里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00142",
      "start_ms": 366300,
      "end_ms": 367675,
      "text": "他慢慢平静下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00143",
      "start_ms": 368620,
      "end_ms": 369445,
      "text": "过了一会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00144",
      "start_ms": 370090,
      "end_ms": 371945,
      "text": "脸上露出一丝微笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00145",
      "start_ms": 372900,
      "end_ms": 374425,
      "text": "又是一个胖娃娃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00146",
      "start_ms": 375630,
      "end_ms": 376150,
      "text": "一晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00147",
      "start_ms": 376150,
      "end_ms": 378945,
      "text": "三个真好一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00148",
      "start_ms": 380860,
      "end_ms": 381965,
      "text": "最后一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00149",
      "start_ms": 382830,
      "end_ms": 384195,
      "text": "还是产房的事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00150",
      "start_ms": 385020,
      "end_ms": 386205,
      "text": "他留下遗嘱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00151",
      "start_ms": 386960,
      "end_ms": 388175,
      "text": "积蓄三万元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00152",
      "start_ms": 389010,
      "end_ms": 395325,
      "text": "全部捐给幼儿园、托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00153",
      "start_ms": 397630,
      "end_ms": 399555,
      "text": "骨灰洒回鼓浪屿的海面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00154",
      "start_ms": 400080,
      "end_ms": 401040,
      "text": "他没当过妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00155",
      "start_ms": 401240,
      "end_ms": 404745,
      "text": "却让五万多个家庭圆了妈这个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00156",
      "start_ms": 405430,
      "end_ms": 408805,
      "text": "他的这一生被完整收进了一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00157",
      "start_ms": 409320,
      "end_ms": 410325,
      "text": "国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00158",
      "start_ms": 410770,
      "end_ms": 413770,
      "text": "中科院学部编的图文并茂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00159",
      "start_ms": 414330,
      "end_ms": 415910,
      "text": "里面不光有林巧智，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00160",
      "start_ms": 416210,
      "end_ms": 422850,
      "text": "还有钱学森、袁隆平、邓稼先等四十位中国科学家的真实人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00161",
      "start_ms": 422990,
      "end_ms": 426970,
      "text": "大人读的心热孩子看得进去链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00162",
      "start_ms": 427130,
      "end_ms": 428650,
      "text": "我放在视频左下角了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00163",
      "start_ms": 429010,
      "end_ms": 431150,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友可以直接拍下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00164",
      "start_ms": 431510,
      "end_ms": 432750,
      "text": "拿到手细细品读。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00165",
      "start_ms": 433670,
      "end_ms": 436110,
      "text": "如果您也心疼这位林妈妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00166",
      "start_ms": 436490,
      "end_ms": 439630,
      "text": "点个赞转发给身边的女性长辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00167",
      "start_ms": 439630,
      "end_ms": 440315,
      "text": "告诉她，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00168",
      "start_ms": 440820,
      "end_ms": 444300,
      "text": "您和您的孩子都曾被这样的人守护过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00169",
      "start_ms": 444720,
      "end_ms": 445920,
      "text": "收藏这条视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00170",
      "start_ms": 446320,
      "end_ms": 449660,
      "text": "下期咱们讲讲开国大典的那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_288404df23ed46a2_s00171",
      "start_ms": 450140,
      "end_ms": 451425,
      "text": "他为什么没有去？"
    }
  ],
